## Original Content
Dolly Parton, légende de la country et icône populaire américaine, est décédée mardi à 80 ans. En mai, la chanteuse, qui aura sorti des dizaines d'albums et écoulé plus de 100 millions de disques tout au long de sa carrière, avait annoncé le report de plusieurs concerts, évoquant des problèmes de santé.

## Summary
Dolly Parton, a legendary American country music singer and pop icon, has died at the age of 80. Earlier in May, she had announced the postponement of concerts due to health issues.

## Key Points
- Dolly Parton has passed away at 80 years old.
- She was a renowned country music legend and popular icon.
- Throughout her career, she released dozens of albums and sold over 100 million records.
- In May, she postponed concerts because of health problems.


